Performance review:

All employees including Executive Board Directors, are assessed through the Company’s annual performance
cycle. The performance of senior income-generating employees is assessed regularly. The focus is on a broad
range of key performance indicators, including some financial performance measures as well as other factors
including risk and compliance metrics i.e. conduct, adherence to internal policy and procedures, minimising
operational losses and timely incident reporting.

The Company has the right to reduce bonuses due in the event of failings relating to regulatory conduct,
treatment of customers, or any other compliance or risk failings.

