The actuarial assumptions used to calculate the Scheme liabilities for the year ended 31 December 2023 are
set out in the table below and have resulted in a increase in the present value of Scheme liabilities of £391k
during the year. As a result of this increase, the Scheme recognised a surplus of £441k in the statement of
